      "title": "Patrick Stewart, Star Trek actor and acclaimed thespian, dies aged 86",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/culture/2026/oct/29/patrick-stewart-dead",
      "description": "<p>Star Trek: the Next Generation and X-Men actor died at his home after ‘a brief and poignant journey with Alzheimer’s disease and Lewy body dementia’</p><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/culture/gallery/2026/oct/29/patrick-stewart-a-life-in-pictures\">Patrick Stewart – a life in pictures</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/film/2026/oct/30/patrick-stewart-death-tribute-shakespearian-actor-superhero\">Patrick Stewart: the commanding Shakespearean thespian who conquered superhero pop culture</a></p></li></ul><p>Patrick Stewart, the acclaimed British stage and screen actor renowned for both Shakespeare and sci-fi, has died. He was 86.</p><p>The Star Trek: the Next Generation and X-Men star died on Wednesday at his home in Los Angeles after “a brief and poignant journey with Alzheimer’s disease and Lewy body dementia”, said Kelly Bush Novak, his longtime spokesperson, to <a href=\"https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/patrick-stewart-dead-star-trek-x-men-1236742932/?bt_ee=1NJ1ZpyYE8zGOPl%2FNjgBJah99TCfgfF7j5t04LCsHdPJyqUFrH%2F7kqL%2BTOdn4f1w&amp;bt_ts=1793303117469#recipient_hashed=c7d2f88b1c4d8837cb2cd4be10b96125330130dfe26c24e331693b1fcabd6a1a&amp;recipient_salt=dfde8ffee9caaf207a291240732588ff48650ac18f2b7d3a026e4023403d5dc5&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_source=exacttarget&amp;utm_campaign=Breaking%20News&amp;utm_content=Patrick%20Stewart,%20%27Star%20Trek%27%20Captain%20and%20%27X-Men%27%20Superhero,%20Dies%20at%2086,%202026-10-29%2012:41:36__&amp;utm_term=c7d63955-664d-4e23-b47a-a2e66b8ebfa7\">the Hollywood Reporter</a>.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/culture/2026/oct/29/patrick-stewart-dead\">Continue reading...</a>",
